s on over 60 maps. Our Editor is also freely available for you to craft just about any custom game mode you can imagine. Join our development journey today!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“As a competitive RTS, Stormgate is what's next”<br>8/10 – IGN<br><br>“Stormgate is definitely an RTS title worth playing”<br>Game Rant<br><br>“Stormgate is shaping up to be a brilliant blend of modern and classic RTS”<br>PC Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/4e251165266f09be89f5b0e61cbd8d832fe2b4e9/header.jpg?t=1777771043", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/45b408aa8bab253ad5b623e04186ec2f91130bdf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777771043", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012510/45b408aa8bab253ad5b623e04186ec2f91130bdf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777771043", "website": "http://playstormgate.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+ (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 6 Cores, 2.3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+ (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8 Cores, 3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2060